# Codon model of autoware_carla_scenario's public API (docs/typecheck.md).
#
# The scenario checker compiles a scenario against these modules instead of
# the Python package: every class and function a scenario can import from
# `autoware_carla_scenario` is declared here with its static types, and nothing
# here runs. test_typecheck_model.py keeps each declaration in step with the
# Python one it models.

